{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n大家估唔估到@minnie_yuenting扮緊咩呢，係地味萬聖節呀！\n</p>\n<p>日文「地味（じみ）」即係「樸素、不起眼」咁解！「地味萬聖節」唔追求要好華麗好得人驚，反而係專門Cosplay日常生活中「啊！真係有呢種人！」嘅瞬間！🎃</p>\n<p>呢個文化源自 2014 年，一班日本網友喺網上分享簡單日常造型，點知一炮而紅！例如「冷氣吹到好凍嘅OL」、「逼地鐵嘅打工仔」，貼地到爆！地味萬聖節嘅魅力就在於「低成本、高趣味」！，唔使使大錢買精緻Cosplay服，只需要屋企現成衫加張說明牌，就可以引起大家共鳴～</p>\n<p>近年仲成為大家萬聖節扮野嘅潮流！</p>\n<p>快啲 share俾萬聖節一齊扮鬼扮馬嘅朋友啦！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179275682342220658_5215482756adb4c57beada.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179275682342220658_5215482756adb4c57beada.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部、AI生成影片、官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/De1S0MkCRql/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:42.485457+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":369,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T12:00:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:27.314186+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:32.040031+00:00","content_hash":"3548bc8a9d6e5dd878efd5680265afe03c43eeb9ad8d3183b3f7d40b6f2d182a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}